# Trims the Docker build context (the repo root). SHARED by the api, admin, and gen image
# builds (apps/api, apps/admin, packages/studio Dockerfiles) — each COPYs only its own
# closure, so this just keeps the heavy/irrelevant stuff (above all the mobile React-Native
# tree + every node_modules) out of the context. Do NOT exclude a package ANY build COPYs.

**/node_modules
.git

# never ship the dotenvx PRIVATE key, and only .env.production is needed
.env.keys
.env.development
.env.example

# not COPYed by any image build. studio + engine are DELIBERATELY NOT excluded:
# the gen image (packages/studio/Dockerfile) COPYs them — excluding 404s its build context.
apps/mobile

# dev/test/build cruft
**/.expo
**/.scratch
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.md
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.github
